# Day 24 - DevTools and Testing a Live Website

## 📚 Learning Objectives

* Learned how to open DevTools.
* Learned how to inspect HTML elements.
* Learned how to inspect CSS rules.
* Tested a live website.

## DevTools

### Open DevTools

Press:

F12

or

Right Click → Inspect

## Important Tabs

### Elements

Used to inspect HTML.

### Styles

Used to inspect CSS.

## Practical Work

* Opened my GitHub Pages website.
* Inspected HTML elements.
* Inspected CSS styles.
* Tested changes in DevTools.
* Fixed issues on my live page.

## Key Takeaways

* DevTools help identify bugs.
* HTML and CSS can be inspected directly in the browser.
* Testing before editing saves time.
* Always verify a website after deployment.
